{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/0a9258e91c4434c6c3a136c8c32064c9.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>\u2014A roguelite \u00d7 puzzle game where quick thinking decides your survival\u2014</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.mp4?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a hybrid that fuses the strategic depth unique to roguelites, the thrill of match-3 puzzles, and the freedom of deckbuilding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aim to strengthen their deck to achieve the target score set for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/1367ecb24c6f0d955a0e1809b74f9bc3.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Lose, retry, and chase that next burst of satisfaction.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Deck-Building\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and enhance your puzzle deck to aim for high scores! <br>Each card triggers a unique chain reaction on the board. The key lies in how you design the connections between your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Relics\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relic choices can make or break a run. It's all up to you! <br>Here are just a few of the many unique relics you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create special blocks with 4-match combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost score multipliers when clearing 3+ colors at once</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having more coins allows you to earn more points</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack relics for massive synergy and score bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Puzzle Techniques\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide the puzzle grid both vertically and horizontally\u2014 <br>This unconventional control scheme demands forward thinking and flexible strategy. <br>Stay sharp! Even tough situations can be turned around with the right moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.mp4?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/27de9863f37b23bf96a78359ce3d7147.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Solve the puzzle\u2026 or face the consequences.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Customize your voxel character with various outfits and styles. <br>Lose a match, and witness your cute avatar meet a shockingly intense voxel fatality\u2014a mix of dark humor and visual flair that\u2019s as satisfying as it is brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of ancient ruins using powerful stone tablets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/4437ab2c3ca81ee381393a6f927e0b77.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/4437ab2c3ca81ee381393a6f927e0b77.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/d3eaecd15ad9519faa48a5e18cb46a60.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Disrupt your rivals and fight for the top spot!</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Up to 8 players can go head-to-head in competitive puzzle battles. <br>Use huge combos to sabotage your opponents\u2014and claim victory with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/64e7b74379c0b1628bbc709930f80104.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/64e7b74379c0b1628bbc709930f80104.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/9e9bbec65f97a023be0918e0f06157d6.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Treasure hunters from around the world set off on a board game-style adventure</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Ancient relics said to grant any wish lie hidden in dangerous ruins. <br>Face powerful guardians like the Desert Sphinx, the Dragon of the Scorched Ruins, or the Kraken of the Sunken Temple\u2014 <br>Defeat them by solving ancient puzzles and uncover the truth behind their legends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogues, outlaws, and rival explorers\u2014each has their own wish. <br>What will yours be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/754072575ed053d4bd9fcd1b0485489c.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/597dc33a91b45cded66476b82bf7d072.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer to the official guidelines available on our website for content creation and streaming permissions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Debut Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3020550/c7f8cced080ad8cdc1e6dbd25e4b9fb18c6c649f.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3020550/b4ea68fd2d8c53ff726b866e4f3585d094f20e78.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3020550/565f