,{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/0a9258e91c4434c6c3a136c8c32064c9.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>\u2014A roguelite \u00d7 puzzle game where quick thinking decides your survival\u2014</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/31001c2b1754f6775af8f1359fb6eedb.mp4?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a hybrid that fuses the strategic depth unique to roguelites, the thrill of match-3 puzzles, and the freedom of deckbuilding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aim to strengthen their deck to achieve the target score set for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/1367ecb24c6f0d955a0e1809b74f9bc3.avif?t=1773281824\" width=1240 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Lose, retry, and chase that next burst of satisfaction.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Deck-Building\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and enhance your puzzle deck to aim for high scores! <br>Each card triggers a unique chain reaction on the board. The key lies in how you design the connections between your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Relics\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your relic choices can make or break a run. It's all up to you! <br>Here are just a few of the many unique relics you\u2019ll encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create special blocks with 4-match combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost score multipliers when clearing 3+ colors at once</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having more coins allows you to earn more points</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack relics for massive synergy and score bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Puzzle Techniques\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide the puzzle grid both vertically and horizontally\u2014 <br>This unconventional control scheme demands forward thinking and flexible strategy. <br>Stay sharp! Even tough situations can be turned around with the right moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.poster.avif?t=1773281824\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.webm?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3020550/extras/ab8e7a75516156329efd9ccf96a75e96.mp4?t=1773281824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></